{"id":"5603","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5603_main_cumulus-congestus-humilis-and-fractus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这是一个发展中的浓积云实例，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处的两个上曳气流中“上部在隆起”。虽然“隆起的上部像花椰菜”，但要指出的是，该积云的垂直厚度不大。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">正在消散的浓积云</span>在主单体的左侧。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">碎</span>积云和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡</span>积云也在图中出现。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Wai Yan Luk","location":"中国，香港，青马大桥","latitude":"纬度: 22° 21' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 4' 24'' E","date":"08 November 2015 1703 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.3"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5603_syn_cumulus-congestus-humilis-and-fractus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>潮湿的向岸气流在内陆400公里汇聚成静止锋</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5603_upper_cumulus-congestus-humilis-and-fractus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>在照片拍摄三小时后的探测 – 利用当地时间17:00香港机场地面条件添加的抬升凝结高度</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4766_main_cumulus-congestus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>积云通常是密集的，具有清晰轮廓，以上升的山丘、圆顶或塔等的形式垂直发展。积云通常是分离的云；虽然无法确定这张图像中的这些云是否分离，但是在海岸外的海面上的阴影表明主要细胞有一定程度的分离。它们还有非常<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">明亮的白色阳光照射部分</span>；相对<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">较暗且近水平的云底</span>；与积云有关的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">强垂直范围</span>。值得注意的是，强烈的萌芽、清晰的轮廓和凸起的上部，类似于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>的花椰菜，决定了其为浓云云种。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Alfons Puertas","location":"西班牙巴塞罗那Vallvidrera","latitude":"纬度: 41° 25' 6'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 7' 27'' E","date":"15 September 2015 1406 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.3","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.3"}]}]}